"HELP_PROFILE_AVATAR" = "To change your avatar:\n1. Open the Profile tab\n2. Tap the gear icon (Settings)\n3. Choose \"User profile\"\n4. Pick a new avatar or upload a photo\n5. Tap \"Save\"";
"Как работает создание скина?" = "How does skin editor work?";
"Редактор аватара и элементы" = "Avatar editor and items";
"HELP_PROFILE_SKIN_EDITOR" = "In the skin editor you build your look from several categories:\n• Clothing\n• Accessories\n• Glasses\n• Skin Tone\n• Hair\n• Face (eyes, mouth, etc.)\n\nHow to use it:\n1. Open Profile → Settings → User profile → Edit avatar\n2. Switch to the \"Create skin\" tab\n3. Pick a category in the top bar (hat, shirt, glasses, palette icons, etc.)\n4. Select a specific item in the grid below – it will instantly appear in the preview\n5. Tap \"Save Avatar\" to apply the skin to your profile\n\nSome items may be locked (lock icon) – they unlock as you progress or for F-bucks.";

/* Help Center – friends & social */
"Как добавить друзей?" = "How to add friends?";
"Социальные функции" = "Social features";
"HELP_SOCIAL_ADD_FRIENDS" = "To add friends:\n1. Open the Profile tab\n2. Tap \"Add Friends\"\n3. Share your friend code or enter another player's code / login\n4. Send a friend request\n\nWith friends you can:\n• Compare stats\n• See their progress\n• Compete in leagues and duels";
"Как работают напоминания друзьям?" = "How do reminders to friends work?";
"Пуш-уведомления о ежедневном уроке" = "Push notifications about daily lesson";
"HELP_SOCIAL_REMINDERS" = "After finishing a game you see a screen with your friends and their streaks:\n• Friends who have already played today show a flame and number of days in streak\n• Friends who haven't played today show a \"Remind\" button\n\nHow to send a reminder:\n1. After your game, go to the \"Remind friends\" screen\n2. Tap \"Remind\" next to a specific friend\n3. If they have notifications enabled, they will get a push that today's lesson is not completed yet\n\nReminders help friends keep their streak and study regularly.";

/* Help Center – duel & progress */
"Что такое дуэль и как её начать?" = "What is a duel and how to start it?";
"Режим соревнований 1 на 1" = "1‑on‑1 competition mode";
"HELP_GAME_DUEL" = "Duel is a mode where you and your friend answer the same questions to compare results.\n\nHow to start a duel:\n1. Open your friend's profile (from Friends list, Leagues or reminders)\n2. Tap the \"Challenge to Duel\" button\n3. Confirm – the duel will use a shared set of questions\n\nAt the end:\n• You see who scored more points\n• Duel motivates and boosts progress but does NOT reset your daily streak";
"Как зарабатывать и тратить F-bucks?" = "How to earn and spend F-bucks?";
"Внутриигровая валюта" = "In‑game currency";
"HELP_PROGRESS_FBUCKS" = "F-bucks (Flags Bucks) are the in‑game currency of World Arena Flags.\n\nHow to earn F-bucks:\n• For perfect games (all answers correct)\n• For long daily streaks\n• For completing quests and achievements\n\nWhat to spend them on:\n• Buying exclusive skin and avatar elements\n• Unlocking rare accessories and effects\n\nImportant: F-bucks are not real money. They cannot be withdrawn or exchanged for real currency.";
"Как работают квесты и достижения?" = "How do quests and achievements work?";
"Месячные задания и артефакты" = "Monthly quests and artifacts";
"HELP_PROGRESS_QUESTS" = "In the \"Quests\" tab you see:\n• Daily quests (if available)\n• Monthly quests and total progress 0–40\n\nHow it works:\n1. Complete tasks: play required number of games, guess flags of specific regions, etc.\n2. Each completed quest gives progress and rewards\n3. Total monthly progress is shown in the colored header as a bar\n\nAchievements (artifacts) unlock for special conditions:\n• Long streaks\n• High accuracy\n• High places in leagues\nUnlocked achievements are shown in your profile.";

/* Help Center – notifications */
"Уведомления: какие бывают и как их настроить?" = "Notifications: types and how to manage them?";
"Ежедневный урок, дуэли и напоминания" = "Daily lesson, duels and reminders";
"HELP_NOTIFICATIONS_TYPES" = "The app can send several types of notifications:\n• Daily lesson and streak reminders\n• Reminders to friends and responses to your reminders\n• Duel challenges and duel results\n\nHow to manage notifications:\n1. Open your device settings\n2. Find World Arena Flags\n3. Enable or disable notification types as you prefer\n\nWe recommend leaving daily lesson reminders enabled so you don't lose your streak.";

